 467:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_sgmii.c ****      *          Initial non-calibrated codes to IOs (functional max codes)
 468:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_sgmii.c ****      *          Calibration signal transitions
 469:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_sgmii.c ****      *              pvt_calib_status ,        r in reg     DYN_CNTL
